      "claim": "Transferable low-F precedents for similar oral small molecules are all below the 20% threshold: SRT2104 13.8%, aliskiren 2.6-5%, and selegiline about 10%.",
      "card_ids": ["C02","C05","C09","C14","C17","C19","C23"]
